sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant Renderer as Chat UI (renderer)
  participant Store as chatStore
  participant IPC as electronAPI (chat)
  participant Main as chat-service (main)
  participant Graph as LangGraph workflow
  participant DB as SQLiteCheckpointSaver

  User->>Renderer: type message
  Renderer->>Store: onSubmit(content)
  Store->>IPC: send chat.streamAssistantResponse
  IPC->>Main: request stream with content + metadata
  Main->>Graph: stream(input, config{thread_id, checkpoint_id?})
  Graph->>DB: load latest checkpoint + writes
  Graph-->>Main: stream updates / interrupt events
  Main-->>IPC: forward StreamChunk updates
  IPC-->>Store: emit status/content
  Store-->>Renderer: render assistant text

  alt workflow pauses (await_user_input)
    Graph-->>Main: __interrupt__ await_user_input + checkpoint_id
    Main-->>Store: status {type: await_user_input, prompt, checkpointId}
    Store-->>Renderer: show banner, disable send button
    User-->>Renderer: provide answer
    Renderer->>Store: submit answer with checkpointId/questionId
    Store->>IPC: send streamAssistantResponse(answer, checkpointId)
    IPC->>Main: resume workflow Command(resume: {answer})
    Main->>Graph: resume from checkpoint
  end

  Graph-->>Main: final content / Complete|Breaker
  Main-->>DB: persist metadata, clear awaitingUserInput
  Main-->>IPC: stream end
  IPC-->>Store: mark assistantTyping=false, awaitingUserInput cleared
  Store-->>Renderer: enable input, show final text
